\par }\pard \qj\fi540\ri9\sb240\sl252\slmult1\widctlpar\adjustright {\'a7\'dea gi\'edi h\'b5nh ch\'ddnh th\'de x\'b7 An Kh\'aa : \'a7\'abng gi\'b8p t\'d8nh B\'d7nh \'a7\'denh; T\'a9y v\'b5 Nam gi\'b8p huy\'d6n \'a7ak P\'ac; B\'bec gi\'b8p huy\'d6n K'Bang v\'b5
